### GET all patients
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients


###

### CREATE patient
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamal Perera",
  "email": "kamal@gmail.com",
  "phone": "0712345678"
}


###

### GET patient by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/2


###

### UPDATE patient
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamal Updated",
  "email": "kamalnew@gmail.com",
  "phone": "0700000000"
}


###

### DELETE patient
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/patients/2